{"unit_id": "RAK7S__dsh-weather-whisper#feature-1", "repo": "RAK7S/dsh-weather-whisper", "commit": "c0c15f7d9079de24deac12fa5727b7eaa7f0dbe7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "天气轻语 · dsh-weather-whisper 的功能「每日与每周天气」：卡片展示当前温度、体感、湿度、风况、明日天气和未来一周的高低温、天气图标及降水概率。插件启动时自动请求预报并渲染卡片。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:411-449", "lib/client.js:956-975"]}
{"unit_id": "RAK7S__dsh-weather-whisper#feature-2", "repo": "RAK7S/dsh-weather-whisper", "commit": "c0c15f7d9079de24deac12fa5727b7eaa7f0dbe7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "天气轻语 · dsh-weather-whisper 的功能「天气风险与穿衣提示」：卡片根据逐时降水、阵风、降雪和今明两日温度生成简短天气提醒，并按体感、降水概率和风况给出穿衣建议。打开卡片即可查看提示。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:216-243", "lib/client.js:270-315", "lib/client.js:977-986"]}
{"unit_id": "RAK7S__dsh-weather-whisper#feature-3", "repo": "RAK7S/dsh-weather-whisper", "commit": "c0c15f7d9079de24deac12fa5727b7eaa7f0dbe7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "天气轻语 · dsh-weather-whisper 的功能「城市定位与切换」：用户可用 IP 自动定位，也可输入城市名切换查询地点；检测到位置与已记住城市相距较远时，会显示候选位置供用户选择。城市按钮打开选择面板。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:359-409", "lib/client.js:935-954", "lib/client.js:1013-1051"]}
{"unit_id": "RAK7S__dsh-weather-whisper#feature-4", "repo": "RAK7S/dsh-weather-whisper", "commit": "c0c15f7d9079de24deac12fa5727b7eaa7f0dbe7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "天气轻语 · dsh-weather-whisper 的功能「卡片主题编辑」：用户可在卡片编辑面板中选用预设或更改背景、文字和强调色、分隔线、角落图案及天气字形，并恢复默认主题。更改通过面板控件触发并保存。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:904-928", "lib/client.js:636-688", "lib/client.js:117-149"]}
{"unit_id": "RAK7S__dsh-weather-whisper#caveat-1", "repo": "RAK7S/dsh-weather-whisper", "commit": "c0c15f7d9079de24deac12fa5727b7eaa7f0dbe7", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "天气轻语 · dsh-weather-whisper 使用前须知：自动定位会向 ipinfo.io 请求位置，并把经纬度发给 BigDataCloud 反查城市；天气和手动城市地理编码分别请求 Open-Meteo 服务。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:359-385", "lib/client.js:411-421"]}
